          <tr style="box-sizing: border-box !important;" class="ver-factura">
            <td class="ph4-ns"
              style="max-width: 360px; width: 100%; background-color: #F5F5F5; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; padding-top: 2.5rem; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: left; padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1rem !important;"
              align="left" bgcolor="#F5F5F5">

              <p class="ver-factura-text"
                style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                Lamentamos informarte que no pudimos completar la entrega de tu pedido, la misma <b>ha vuelto a nuestro
                  depósito.</b> </p>
              <br>
              <p class="ver-factura-text"
                style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                Entendemos lo frustrante que esto puede ser y para no retener tu dinero <strong>ya realizamos el
                  reintegro al mismo medio de pago que utilizaste.</strong> </p>
              <br>
              <p class="ver-factura-text"
                style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                Te pedimos sinceras disculpas por cualquier inconveniente, a continuación te dejamos la información del
                reintegro: </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="box-sizing: border-box !important;" class="ver-factura">
            <td class="ph4-ns"
              style="max-width: 360px; width: 100%; background-color: #F5F5F5; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse;  padding-top: 1rem; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: left; padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1rem !important;"
              align="left" bgcolor="#F5F5F5">
              <div style="border: 1px solid #757575; padding: 20px 11px">
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    <p class="ver-factura-text"
                      style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                      <strong>Tarjeta de crédito:</strong> El reembolso aparecerá en tu próximo resumen o el siguiente,
                      dependiendo de la fecha de cierre.</p>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <p class="ver-factura-text"
                      style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                      <strong>Tarjeta de débito:</strong> Verás el reembolso reflejado en tu cuenta dentro del plazo
                      habitual del banco.</p>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <p class="ver-factura-text"
                      style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                      <strong>Mercado Crédito:</strong> Se analizará tu situación, y si corresponde, se realizará el
                      reintegro del total abonado (incluyendo intereses) a tu cuenta de Mercado Pago.</p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="box-sizing: border-box !important;" class="ver-factura">
            <td class="ph4-ns"
              style=" max-width: 360px; width: 100%; background-color: #F5F5F5; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; padding-top: 1rem; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: left; padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1rem !important;"
              align="left" bgcolor="#F5F5F5">
              <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #BEBEBE; padding-bottom: 24px;">

                <p class="ver-factura-text"
                  style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                  Si tenés alguna pregunta o necesitas asistencia adicional, no dudes en contactarnos haciendo <a
                    href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=5491171367844" target="_blank">click aquí</a> o escaneando
                  este código QR.</p>
                <br>
                <div>
                  <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center"
                    style="margin:auto;">
                    <tr>
                      <td style="padding: 10px; text-align:center;">
                        <img
                          src="data:image/png;base64,"
                          alt="Escaneá para contactarnos" width="180" height="180"
                          style="border: 4px solid #eee; padding: 5px; border-radius: 8px;">
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <!-- Botón de WhatsApp -->
                    <tr>
                      <td style="padding: 10px; text-align: center;">
                        <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=5491171367844" target="_blank"
                          style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 25px; background:#25D366; color:white; border-radius:6px;">
                          Contactános
                        </a>

                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </div>
                <p class="ver-factura-text"
                  style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                  Estamos acá para ayudarte. </p>
                <br>
                <p class="ver-factura-text"
                  style="box-sizing: border-box;  font-style: normal;  font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: #000; text-align: left;">
                  Gracias por tu comprensión. </p>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr style="box-sizing: border-box !important;" class="ver-factura">
            <td class="ph4-ns"
              style=" max-width: 360px; width: 100%; background-color: #F5F5F5; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; padding-top: 18px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: left; padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1rem !important;"
              align="left" bgcolor="#F5F5F5">
              <h3
                style="margin: 0; margin-top: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; font-size: 28px; line-height: 32px; color: #000; margin-bottom: 4px !important; text-align: left;">
                Tu pedido</h3>
              {{#compare subjectItemAttachment.totalItems '==' '1'}}
              <h5 class="paquete-entrega-cant"
                style="margin: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #000; margin-top: 0 !important; text-align: left;">
                {{subjectItemAttachment.totalItems}} producto</h5>
              {{else}}
              <h5 class="paquete-entrega-cant"
                style="margin: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #000; margin-top: 0 !important; text-align: left;">
                {{subjectItemAttachment.totalItems}} productos</h5>
              {{/compare}}
              {{#richShippingData shippingData}}
              {{#group logisticsInfo by="addessId"}}
              {{#group items by="packageId"}}
              <table class="paquete-entrega-tabla" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                style="width: 100%; height: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 100%; mso-table-rspace: 0pt !important;">
                {{#each items}}
                {{#each ../../../../items}}
                {{#eq id ../itemId}}
                <tr class="paquete-entrega-item"
                  style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E6E6EB; box-sizing: border-box !important;">
                  <td class="paquete-entrega-tabla-img"
                    style="width: 5.4rem; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; padding-right: .5rem; padding-top: .5rem; padding-bottom: .5rem; vertical-align: top; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: left; border-top: none; border-bottom: none !important;"
                    align="left" valign="top">
                    <img alt="" src="{{imageUrl}}"
                      style="width: 88px; border-radius: 7px; vertical-align: top; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; max-width: 100% !important;" />
                  </td>
                  <td
                    style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; padding-top: .5rem; padding-bottom: .5rem; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: left; border-top: none; border-bottom: none; vertical-align: top !important;"
                    align="left" valign="top">

                    <div class="paquete-entrega-tabla-skuID"
                      style="font-size: 17px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: initial; box-sizing: border-box; color: #000; !important; text-align: left;">
                      SKU: {{id}}
                    </div>
                    <div class="mv1-ns paquete-entrega-tabla-name"
                      style="font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #000; text-transform: lowercase; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.25 !important; text-align: left;">
                      {{name}}</div>

                    <div class="paquete-entrega-tabla-unitPrice"
                      style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-sizing: border-box; color: #000; !important; text-align: left;">
                    </div>

                    <label class="paquete-entrega-tabla-unit"
                      style="font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #000; margin-left: 0px; display: block !important;">{{quantity}}
                      un.</label>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                {{/eq}}
                {{/each}}
                {{/each}}
              </table>
              {{/group}}
              {{/group}}
              {{/richShippingData}}
              {{!-- DETALLE DEL PEDIDO/ CAMBIAR ACA URL DE ORDER DEL SITIO--}}
              <div class="detalle-pedido"
                style="border: 1px solid #000000; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 3px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px; margin-top: 15px; text-align: center !important;">
                <a href="https://www.lamartina.com.ar/account/#/orders/{{orderId}}"
                  style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: 18px; color: #000; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; width: 100% !important;">Ver
                  detalles del pedido</a>
              </div>
              {{!-- DETALLE DEL PEDIDO --}}
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr style="background: #D9D9D9; padding: 36px 24px; box-sizing: border-box !important;" class="footer">
            <td class="ph4-ns"
              style="max-width: 360px; width: 100%; background-color: #fff; background: #D9D9D9; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-color: #eee; padding-top: 1rem; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: center; padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem; padding: 24px; padding-bottom: 1rem !important;"
              align="left" bgcolor="#fff">
              <img
                src="https://lamartina.vtexassets.com/assets/vtex/assets-builder/lamartina.store-theme/3.0.33/logos/Logo___43a1372260c2a6d7d485d3bcb54b332f.svg"
                alt="logo la martina"
                style="vertical-align: top; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; max-width: 100%; width: 100px !important;">

              </img>
            </td>
